Kaynak: awesome-ad-video-prompts (CC BY 4.0) · https://github.com/LichAmnesia/awesome-ad-video-prompts', 'Wireless earbuds and their charging case float in exploded-view layout against a deep-navy gradient void, lit by one soft overhead box. 0-2s: components drift apart in zero gravity — lid, both buds, and silicone tips suspended and slowly rotating, brushed-metal and matte-plastic surfaces catching crisp specular highlights. 2-4s: a parallax orbit left as a cyan accent edge-light traces every seam, micro-reflections rolling along the glossy stems. 4-6s: the parts magnetically draw back together and seat with a clean close, [brand] etched on the hinge. Each part holds constant geometry, scale, and finish — no jitter, duplication, intersection clipping, or warping. Sound: weightless hum, a magnetic click, soft confirmation chime.', array['veo', 'seedance', 'kling']::text[], 'video', 'product_commercial', 'technology', 'published', 'public', 'original', null, '2026-08-26T21:13:59.559Z', '2026-08-26T21:13:59.559Z');

